ome\\(Function predicate\\)#{2}":[680,680],"#Stream - Scoped, Global#Stream - some\\(Function predicate\\)#{3}":[681,682],"#Stream - Scoped, Global#Stream - some\\(Function predicate\\)#{4}":[683,703],"#Stream - Scoped, Global#Stream - toArray\\(Number count\\)":[704,763],"#Stream - Scoped, Global#Stream - toArray\\(Number count\\)#{1}":[706,763],"#Stream - Scoped, Global#Related":[764,768],"#Stream - Scoped, Global#Related#{1}":[766,766],"#Stream - Scoped, Global#Related#{2}":[767,768]},"outlinks":[{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":24},{"title":"GlideQuery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideQueryGlobalAPI.md","line":29},{"title":"fromArray\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md","line":31},{"title":"GlideQuery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideQueryGlobalAPI.md","line":37},{"title":"Optional","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md","line":37},{"title":"aggregate","target":"r_Aggregate","line":47},{"title":"every\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md","line":67},{"title":"find\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md","line":68},{"title":"forEach\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md","line":69},{"title":"reduce\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md","line":70},{"title":"some\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md","line":71},{"title":"toArray\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md","line":72},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":74},{"title":"GlideQuery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideQueryGlobalAPI.md","line":80},{"title":"GlideQuery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideQueryGlobalAPI.md","line":266},{"title":"GlideQuery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideQueryGlobalAPI.md","line":471},{"title":"w3schools documentation","target":"https://www.w3schools.com/jsref/jsref_reduce.asp","line":589},{"title":"aggregate","target":"r_Aggregate","line":766},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":767}],"metadata":{"title":"Stream - Scoped, Global","description":"The Stream API provides methods to interact with a stream of items such as records. For example, you can use the forEach\\(\\) method to update the state of each record in a stream returned by the GlideQuery API.Instantiates a Stream object.Returns results in batches of arrays, each containing the number of records passed to the method.Applies a predicate function to every item in the Stream object. If the predicate returns true for every item in the stream, the method returns true. If the predicate returns false for any item in the stream, the method returns false.Applies a predicate function to each item in the Stream object. If the predicate returns true, the method returns the stream. If the predicate returns false, it returns an empty Stream object.Returns the first record or item in the Stream object that matches the predicate function. If no predicate function is provided, then the method returns the first record or item in the Stream.Applies a function to every item in a stream. Returns another stream that you can iterate over.Applies the specified function to each record or item in the stream.Returns a Stream object that contains the values from the provided array.Limits the number of results returned by the stream.Applies a function to each item in a stream and returns the updated Stream object.Executes a reducer function on each item in the stream, resulting in single output value.Applies a predicate function, a function that takes a single value and returns true or false, to each item in the stream. If the predicate returns true for any item in the stream, the method returns true.Returns an array containing the given number of items from the stream.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":13,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[43,53],[57,61],[88,97],[101,112],[128,136],[140,195],[199,211],[245,254],[258,260],[278,285],[301,312],[316,318],[336,357],[361,394],[410,416],[420,433],[451,459],[463,465],[483,504],[508,539],[555,565],[569,583],[635,646],[650,652],[686,696],[700,702],[718,725],[729,762]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md"},
